{
  "id": "reversing-anti-tamper",
  "workdir": "/home/student/task",
  "hostname": "lab",
  "expect": {
    "file": "/home/student/task/found.txt",
    "contains": "nto{t4mp3r_ch3ck_n3utr4l1z3d}"
  },
  "fs": [
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task",
      "type": "dir"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/task.md",
      "text": "# Задача: обойти anti-tamper\n\n`guard` защищает секцию `protected` контрольной суммой CRC32: любая правка байта — и\nпрограмма печатает `integrity check failed`.\n\n1. Запусти `guard` — увидишь отказ.\n2. `objdump -d guard` — найди функцию `check`.\n3. В gdb принудительно установи совпадение: `set var crc=0xdeadbeef`, затем `continue`.\n\nФлаг запиши в `found.txt` и набери `check`.\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/guard",
      "b64": "",
      "mode": "755"
    }
  ],
  "tools": {
    "guard": {
      "help": "guard — проверка целостности",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": ".*",
          "example": "guard",
          "output": "integrity check failed (crc=0x6d26ffc7)\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    "gdb": {
      "help": "gdb -batch -ex '<команда>' guard",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "set var crc",
          "example": "gdb -batch -ex 'b check' -ex run -ex 'set var crc=0xdeadbeef' -ex continue guard",
          "output": "Breakpoint 1 at 0x4011b4: file guard.c, line 10.\n[Thread debugging using libthread_db enabled]\nUsing host libthread_db library \"/usr/lib/libthread_db.so.1\".\n\nBreakpoint 1, check (crc=1831272391) at guard.c:10\n10\t__attribute__((noinline)) int check(unsigned int crc){\nlicense: nto{t4mp3r_ch3ck_n3utr4l1z3d}\n[Inferior 1 (process 465054) exited normally]\n"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
